---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/quiz/"
pageId: "later-quiz"
title: "The Quiz"
description: "Guess how much living costs went up this year, then see the sourced figures."
---
{#- The cost-of-living quiz (records/changes/CHG-019). Repo-authored since
    CHG-019: tools/gen_static_pages.py no longer writes this file from the
    export's placeholder. pageId stays "later-quiz" because sections.css styles
    the page by it.

    Every answer comes from sources/register.csv through _data/quiz.js and
    _data/register.js, rendered by partials/figure.njk inside its data-source.
    No figure is typed here, in js/quiz.js or in the copy; the questions are the
    only fixed text, and _data/quiz.js holds them.

    Without JavaScript this is the page: the five questions with their sourced
    answers as a plain list, then the end block. js/quiz.js turns it into one
    question at a time. It makes no network call and stores nothing: the
    guesses never leave the browser. -#}
{% import "partials/figure.njk" as fig %}
<!-- SECTION: quiz — title -->
<div class="titleband" data-screen-label="Quiz — title"><h1>The <span class="u-1">Quiz</span></h1></div>
{#- No defer, and before the quiz: js/quiz-early.js runs before the parser
    reaches the answers, so a slow js/quiz.js (deferred) never lets them show
    first. The layout has no per-page <head> slot, and this keeps every other
    page unchanged. It marks <html> with .quiz-js, which integration.css item
    150 reads; js/quiz.js removes the mark once it has set its own state. #}
<script src="/js/quiz-early.js"></script>
<div class="sys" data-quiz data-quiz-url="{{ site.origin }}{{ page.url }}" data-quiz-text="{{ description }}">
  <!-- SECTION: quiz — intro -->
  <div class="card quiz-intro" data-screen-label="Quiz — intro">
    <div class="cap"><p class="quiz-cap">The cost-of-living quiz</p></div>
    <div class="bd">
      <div class="eq">Guess, then check the record</div>
      <h2>How much did living costs go up this year?</h2>
      <p>{{ quiz.total }} questions about prices over the past year. Make a guess, then see the sourced figure and how close you were.</p>
      <p>Your guesses stay in this browser. Nothing is sent, stored or tracked.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- SECTION: quiz — questions -->
  <ol class="quiz-list" data-quiz-list>
{% for q in quiz.questions %}
    <li class="card quiz-q" data-quiz-q data-screen-label="Quiz — question {{ q.n }}">
      <div class="cap"><p class="quiz-cap">Question {{ q.n }} of {{ quiz.total }}</p></div>
      <div class="bd">
        <div class="eq">{{ q.sector }}</div>
        <h2 id="qz-{{ q.n }}-h" tabindex="-1">{{ q.question }}</h2>
        {#- The slider and its linked number input are built by js/quiz.js from
            these attributes: they only work with JavaScript, and a page built with
            the forms off may ship no form control at all (audit_website.py,
            form-rendered, "never allowlisted"). The no-JS view needs neither. -#}
        <div class="quiz-guess" data-quiz-guess data-quiz-n="{{ q.n }}" data-min="-5" data-max="25" data-step="0.5" data-start="0" data-label="Your guess, as a percent change" data-num-label="Or type it" hidden>
          <div class="actions"><button type="button" class="u-btn u-btn--primary" data-quiz-check>Check my guess</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-reveal" data-quiz-reveal data-source="{{ q.id }}" data-quiz-value="{{ q.value }}" data-quiz-display="{{ q.row.display_value }}">
          <h3 id="qz-{{ q.n }}-rh" tabindex="-1">The record</h3>
          <p class="quiz-verdict" data-quiz-verdict hidden></p>
          <div class="cards">
      {{ fig.card(q.row) }}
          </div>
          <p class="quiz-src">{{ q.row.data_period }} · {{ q.row.region }} · Source: <a href="{{ q.row.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ q.row.source_line }}</a></p>
          <div class="actions" data-quiz-next-wrap hidden><button type="button" class="u-btn u-btn--ink" data-quiz-next>Next question</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
{% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <!-- SECTION: quiz — end -->
  <div class="card quiz-end" data-quiz-end data-screen-label="Quiz — end">
    <div class="cap"><p class="quiz-cap">Your results</p></div>
    <div class="bd">
      <h2 id="qz-end-h" tabindex="-1">Your guesses vs. the record</h2>
      <p class="quiz-nojs" data-quiz-nojs>Each answer is above, with its source. With JavaScript on, you can guess first and compare.</p>
      <table class="vhist quiz-sum" data-quiz-summary hidden>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Question</th><th scope="col">Your guess</th><th scope="col">The record</th><th scope="col">Difference</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
{% for q in quiz.questions %}
          <tr data-quiz-sum-row><th scope="row">{{ q.sector }}</th><td data-quiz-sum-guess></td><td data-source="{{ q.id }}">{{ q.row.display_value }}</td><td data-quiz-sum-diff></td></tr>
{% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <h3>Get updates by email</h3>
      <p>Get Uncost updates by email: new figures, what they mean, and their sources.</p>
      {% include "partials/forms/updates.njk" %}
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/case/" class="u-btn u-btn--ghost">Read The Case</a>
        <a href="/sectors/" class="u-btn u-btn--ghost">Explore the sectors</a>
        <a href="/pledge/" class="u-btn u-btn--primary">Sign the Pledge</a>
      </div>
      <div class="actions" data-quiz-share-wrap hidden><button type="button" class="u-btn u-btn--ink" data-quiz-share>Share the quiz</button></div>
      <p class="quiz-note" data-quiz-share-note role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="skip-link" data-quiz-live aria-live="polite"></p>
</div>
<script src="/js/quiz.js" defer></script>
